    "commit": "a9b87037a6fd443bcc7aebeb96634ceab4e6bb18",
    "note": "targets, leak and vocabularyGap were judged against the spec at this commit"
  },
  "split": {
    "rule": "Stratified by source (user ask / commit subject) x leak band (0 / under 0.5 / 0.5 and up). Within each stratum, queries sort by sha256 of their text (lowercased, whitespace collapsed) and alternate dev, held-out, dev, ...; the two known failures (\"summary tree\", \"UniiChat\") are pinned to dev and lead their stratum."
